Package: icloud-on-linux
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Luis Cuellar <135315478+luiscuellar31@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: net
Priority: optional
Depends: @SHLIBS@, rclone (>= 1.75.2), fuse3
Homepage: https://github.com/luiscuellar31/icloud-on-linux
Description: native iCloud Drive client for the Linux desktop
 Signs in to iCloud Drive through rclone and opens it read-only in the file
 manager. The app is written in Rust with GTK 4 and libadwaita.
